  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to International Commission on Missing Persons - Accounting for people missing as a consequence of the Kosovo conflict</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Support to International Commission on Missing Persons</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome A: Capacities of relevant authorities involved in the process of accounting for missing persons in Kosovo further strengthened; 
Outcome B: Continued engagement of families of missing persons in the process of accounting for Kosovo conflict missing persons;
Outcome C:  Regional cooperation to address the issue of persons missing from the Kosovo conflict enhanced. 

On Outcome A: 

- Cases of unidentified human remains in Institute of Forensic Medicine mortuary forensically reviewed and recommendations for case resolution provided to the Kosovo authorities
- Biological samples from exhumations in Kosovo and Serbia are DNA tested and matched for the purpose of human identification of missing persons
- Designated staff from the Institute for Forensic Medicine trained in use of Total Station at exhumations and in post-mortem examination and sampling
- Kosovo Agency on Forensics capacities in DNA analysis for the purpose of human identification of conflict-related missing persons cases strengthened

On Outcome B: 
- Families of missing persons better informed on the process of accounting for missing persons in Kosovo, and awareness of youth and the general public in Kosovo on the issue of missing persons raised

On Outcome C: 
- Increased cooperation between Kosovo and Serbia government commissions on missing persons to account for missing persons</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet syftar till att bygga och st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos ber&#xf6;rda myndigheter som &#xe4;r involverade i
processen att redovisa f&#xf6;rsvunna personer i Kosovo; att engagera familjer till saknade
personer som h&#xe5;ller p&#xe5; att redog&#xf6;ra f&#xf6;r saknade personer i Kosovokonflikten; och att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra
regionalt samarbete f&#xf6;r att ta itu med fr&#xe5;gan om personer som saknas fr&#xe5;n Kosovokonflikten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build and strenthen the capacities of relevant authorities involved in
the process of accounting for missing persons in Kosovo; to engage families of missing
persons in the process of accounting for Kosovo conflict missing persons; and to enhance
regional cooperation to address the issue of persons missing from the Kosovo conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
